From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tonrakun <tonrakun@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:39:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Kodama configuration

License: GPL-3.0 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html)

Based on "Gale configuration" from Gale (https://github.com/Dreeam-qwq/Gale), GPL-3.0,
itself based on "Paper config files" from Paper.

Adds kodama-global.yml, kodama-world-defaults.yml and the per-world
kodama-world.yml, the safe/balanced/aggressive preset with preset-dependent
values, validated hot reload and the FeatureGuard exception safety net.

